# Keep the repository content LF regardless of the contributor's platform.
#
# `epson_usb/` is a byte-for-byte copy of the `epson_usb` package of
# https://github.com/Ircama/epson-l3251-usb-reset (see epson_usb/README.md):
# that project pins LF the same way, and a checkout that rewrites those files
# with CRLF would break the copy property, not the code.
* text=auto eol=lf
